    0
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route120_EventScript_1519B3",
   "texts": {
    "Route120_Text_1BEFC8": "Do you have any moves that can strike\\na flying POKéMON?$",
    "Route120_Text_1BF000": "You soared above me!$",
    "Route120_Text_1BF015": "The move FLY is convenient, don't\\nyou think?\\pWhile the POKéMON is flying, almost\\nno moves can strike it.$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 12,
   "x": 32,
   "y": 14,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_MAN_6",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_RIGHT",
   "range": [
    0,
    0
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route120_EventScript_1519CA",
   "texts": {
    "Route120_Text_1BF07E": "My POKéMON is strong!\\nHow about yours?$",
    "Route120_Text_1BF0A5": "Your POKéMON were stronger...$",
    "Route120_Text_1BF0C3": "A POKéMON that grows steadily is one\\nyou can count on.$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 13,
   "x": 27,
   "y": 51,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_CAMPER",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_LEFT",
   "range": [
    0,
    0
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route120_EventScript_151A08",
   "texts": {
    "Route120_Text_1BF193": "I'll check your POKéMON and see if\\nthey're fit for the outdoors.$",
    "Route120_Text_1BF1D4": "With POKéMON that strong, you're in\\nno danger of needing rescue!$",
    "Route120_Text_1BF215": "To travel wherever your heart desires\\nwith POKéMON...\\lThat's the joy of being a TRAINER.$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 14,
   "x": 36,
   "y": 45,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_PICNICKER",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_LEFT",
   "range": [
    0,
    0
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route120_EventScript_151A1F",
   "texts": {
    "Route120_Text_1BF26E": "How's your physical fitness?\\nIf you're not fit, you could have a\\lrough time in critical situations.$",
    "Route120_Text_1BF2D2": "I'm totally fit, but...$",
    "Route120_Text_1BF2EA": "Fitness training is in my routine.\\nI always run with my POKéMON.$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 15,
   "x": 19,
   "y": 80,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_MANIAC",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_UP_AND_LEFT",
   "range": [
